§§ `DBS yuu at SimplyGo -- the cap admits S$811, not S$822, because SimplyGo has its own row`

-- The one yuu row where the sheet is wrong on the text rather than rounding
-- it. The sheet annotates SimplyGo "also a yuu merchant" and carries the
-- S$822 cap figure across. SimplyGo is NOT yuu Merchant Spend in this
-- document: cl.6's Base Rewards table and cl.7(a)'s Bonus Rewards table each
-- give it a row of its own, at different numbers.
--   [dbs-yuu-card-tnc cl.6, Base Rewards table] "SimplyGo  0.5 yuu Point
--     (0.25% cash rebates)"  -- against "yuu Merchant Spend  1 yuu Point"
--   [dbs-yuu-card-tnc cl.7(a)] "SimplyGo  9.5 yuu Points (4.75% cash
--     rebates)"  -- against "yuu Merchant Spend  9 yuu Points"
-- So the bonus denominator is 9.5 + 26 = 35.5, and cl.7's 28,800-point cap
-- admits 28,800 / 35.5 = S$811.27 of bonus-earning spend, S$11.59 less than
-- the sheet's figure. S$822 is not a rounding of S$811.27 in any direction.
--
-- The RATE is unaffected and stays in the rounding cluster above: 0.5 + 9.5 +
-- 26 is the same 36 points per S$1 as a yuu merchant, hence the same 10.08.
-- That coincidence is why the cap is the only place the row's error shows.

-- [S5] "Public transport (SimplyGo) | DBS yuu (10, S$822, also a yuu merchant)"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:635 claims 822; the text answers 28800 / 35.5.
-- [dbs-yuu-card-tnc cl.7(a)] "SimplyGo  9.5 yuu Points (4.75% cash rebates)" -- 28,800 / 35.5 = 811.27
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `DBS yuu Visa` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 simplygo`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 822)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `DBS yuu Visa` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 simplygo`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 28800 / 35.5


§§ `POSB PAssion Debit -- the Promotion Period ended on 30 September 2025`

-- Seven failures with one cause. The document that pays the sheet's "5 mpd,
-- ~S$507" fixes its own life and that life is over; the fixtures are dated
-- June 2026, nine months outside it.
--   [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.3] "The Promotion is valid from 1 October 2023
--     to 30 September 2025 ("Promotion Period")."
--   [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.4] ""Qualified Spend" refers to retail
--     transactions charged to the PAssion Card within the Promotion Period,
--     and posted into the Card account at the point of computation of yuu
--     Points."
-- The document is "Updated as of 30 May 2025" and nothing held renews it, so
-- the module answers 0 with status `Source expired` rather than guessing that
-- it rolled over. `capped` goes FALSE with the rate, because no bonus runs
-- against the pot; the pot is still named on the answer.
--
-- TWO INDEPENDENT GROUNDS, recorded so the row is not read as resting only on
-- the expiry. Measured on this branch by re-dating the same fixtures into the
-- Promotion Period: the card then answers 5.04 miles per dollar (3X + 15X =
-- 18 yuu Points at cl.12's 0.28), not the sheet's 5; and a cap of S$333.33
-- (cl.8(b)'s 5,000 yuu Points over 15 bonus points per S$1), not the sheet's
-- S$507, which no clause in the bundle produces.
--   [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.8(b)] "Capped at a maximum of S$25 cash rebate
--     (5,000 yuu Points) to be awarded per Cardmember per Qualifying Month"
-- The Malaysian Ringgit row fails a third time over, in period or out:
--   [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.8(d)] "Retail transactions made at Participating
--     Merchants located outside of Singapore and/or charged in foreign
--     currencies, are not eligible for this Promotion."

-- [S5] "PAssion Debit (5, S$507) -> PRVI (1.4)"
-- (d) cheatsheet-claims.l4:386 claims 5; the text answers 0.
-- [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.3] "The Promotion is valid from 1 October 2023 to 30 September 2025"
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `POSB PAssion Debit` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 cold storage`)'s `miles per dollar` EQUALS 5)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `POSB PAssion Debit` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 cold storage`)'s `miles per dollar` EQUALS 0

-- [S5] "PAssion Debit (5, S$507) -> PRVI (1.4)"
-- (d) cheatsheet-claims.l4:387 claims 507; the text answers 0.
-- [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.3] "The Promotion is valid from 1 October 2023 to 30 September 2025"
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `POSB PAssion Debit` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 cold storage`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 507)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `POSB PAssion Debit` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 cold storage`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 0

-- [S5] "PAssion Debit (5, S$507) -> WWC/Citi (4)"
-- (d) cheatsheet-claims.l4:445 claims 5; the text answers 0.
-- [posb-passion-yuu-tnc cl.3] "The Promotion is valid from 1 October 2023 to 30 September 2025"
