§§ `HSBC Revolution at MCC 5411 -- a convenience store is not an Eligible Transaction at all`

-- Four failures, and the sheet is simply wrong on the document. It routes
-- 7-Eleven and Cheers to "Revolution (4, S$1k, contactless)". Both fixtures
-- are MCC 5411, on the sheet's own labelling, and the tap is a wallet token
-- at a terminal -- so cl.5 is satisfied and cl.7 is not:
--   [hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc cl.7] ""Eligible Transactions" refers
--     to Selected Contactless Payments and Selected Online Transactions that
--     fall within any one of the following MCCs:"
-- MCC 5411 is not on that list. Measured 2026-09-21: the string "5411" does
-- not occur anywhere in hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc.txt or in
-- hsbc-revolution-faq.txt. The list's headings are Department Stores, Dining
-- excluding hotel dining, Rental and Lodging, Travel related, Transportation
-- and Membership Clubs, and a run of specialty retail -- no groceries or
-- convenience limb. A charge that is not an Eligible Transaction falls to:
--   [hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc cl.8] "Cardholders are entitled to earn
--     1 Reward point for every SGD1 charged on all other Qualifying
--     Transactions that are not Eligible Transactions."
-- which is 0.4 miles per dollar, and the S$1,000 bonus pool is never reached,
-- so `capped` is FALSE and the dollar figure on it is meaningless. Both
-- halves of the cell fail for the one reason.
--
-- The 0.4 conversion is itself `Unconfirmed` in the module -- cl.13 puts the
-- points-to-miles rate in the HSBC Rewards Programme terms, which this corpus
-- does not hold -- but that is not what these four assertions turn on: the
-- sheet's 4 and the module's 0.4 differ by the bonus, not by the conversion.

-- [S5] "Revolution (4, S$1k, contactless)"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:522 claims 4; the text answers 0.4.
-- [hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc cl.7] MCC 5411 is on no Eligible Transactions list; cl.8 gives "1 Reward point for every SGD1"
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `HSBC Revolution` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 seven eleven`)'s `miles per dollar` EQUALS 4)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `HSBC Revolution` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 seven eleven`)'s `miles per dollar` EQUALS 0.4

-- [S5] "Revolution (4, S$1k, contactless)"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:523 claims 1000; the text answers 0.
-- [hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc cl.7] not an Eligible Transaction, so cl.7.2's bonus pool is never reached
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `HSBC Revolution` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 seven eleven`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 1000)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `HSBC Revolution` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 seven eleven`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 0

-- [S5] "Revolution (4, S$1k, contactless)"
