§§ `Citi Rewards and the mobile wallet -- the exclusion is on the online limb only`

-- PRE-REGISTERED DISCREPANCY 2 of 2, and four failures. The sheet states the
-- exclusion without a qualifier: "Does NOT earn: mobile wallet (Apple/Google
-- Pay) -- pay by card or card-on-file". The T&C attaches it to ONE of cl.6's
-- two limbs.
--   [citi-rewards-10x-tnc cl.6(i)] "a Qualifying Charge made at any store that
--     sells shoes and bags and clothes as its main business activity,
--     determined by the following Merchant Category Codes (MCC)" -- MCC 5311
--     Department Stores, 5611, 5621, 5631, 5641 Children's and Infant's Wear
--     Stores, 5651 Family Clothing Stores. No wallet language anywhere in it.
--   [citi-rewards-10x-tnc cl.6(ii)] "a Qualifying Charge made at an online
--     retail merchant, excluding mobile wallet and travel-related
--     transactions*."
-- Measured 2026-09-21: "mobile wallet" occurs in the Citi bundle exactly
-- twice, at cl.6(ii) of the T&C and at the FAQ's restatement of the same
-- limb. It occurs nowhere in citi-rewards-exclusion-list.txt.
--
-- So a wallet tap that lands on cl.6(i) by its MCC still earns 10X. All four
-- fixtures here do: Mothercare in store and online at 5641, UNIQLO Japan at
-- 5651, Takashimaya at 5311. The instruction the household is following --
-- never pay Citi with a wallet -- costs it 3.6 miles per dollar at exactly
-- the shops the card was chosen for.
--
-- These four assert `earns the bonus rate`, which is the field the cell is
-- about. The rate assertions on the same fixtures passed, which is why they
-- are not repeated here.

-- [S5] merchant reference: "Does NOT earn: **mobile wallet (Apple/Google Pay) -- pay by card or card-on-file**"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:886 claims FALSE; the text answers TRUE.
-- [citi-rewards-10x-tnc cl.6(i)] the MCC limb carries no wallet language; cl.6(ii) is where "excluding mobile wallet" sits
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 kids wear in store`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS FALSE)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 kids wear in store`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS TRUE

-- [S5] merchant reference: "Does NOT earn: **mobile wallet (Apple/Google Pay) -- pay by card or card-on-file**"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:887 claims FALSE; the text answers TRUE.
-- [citi-rewards-10x-tnc cl.6(i)] the MCC limb carries no wallet language; cl.6(ii) is where "excluding mobile wallet" sits
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 kids wear online`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS FALSE)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 kids wear online`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS TRUE

-- [S5] merchant reference: "Does NOT earn: **mobile wallet (Apple/Google Pay) -- pay by card or card-on-file**"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:906 claims FALSE; the text answers TRUE.
-- [citi-rewards-10x-tnc cl.6(i)] the MCC limb carries no wallet language; cl.6(ii) is where "excluding mobile wallet" sits
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 everything else overseas`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS FALSE)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 everything else overseas`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS TRUE

-- [S5] merchant reference: "Does NOT earn: **mobile wallet (Apple/Google Pay) -- pay by card or card-on-file**"
-- (a) cheatsheet-claims.l4:907 claims FALSE; the text answers TRUE.
-- [citi-rewards-10x-tnc cl.6(i)] the MCC limb carries no wallet language; cl.6(ii) is where "excluding mobile wallet" sits
#ASSERT NOT ((`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 a wallet tap in a department store`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS FALSE)
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `Citi Rewards` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` (`S5 the same purchase paid with a wallet token` `S5 a wallet tap in a department store`))'s `earns the bonus rate` EQUALS TRUE

-- PRE-REGISTERED DISCREPANCY 1 of 2, pinned on the branch the cell is about.
-- The sheet's 4 is not a figure the module lacks: it is the module's
-- `miles per dollar if the merchant flags online`. What the sheet asserts and
-- the text denies is that a wallet tap in store SETTLES that branch.
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `DBS Woman's World` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 a wallet tap in a department store`)'s `miles per dollar if the merchant flags online` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `DBS Woman's World` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 a wallet tap in a department store`)'s `depends on the merchant indicator`
